    "UIName": "Ku IFV",
    "Id": "vehicledef_APC_KU_TURHAN2_CLAN",
    "Name": "Ku IFV",
    "Details": "This variant returns the Ku back to its parent design's original mission of infantry fighting vehicle / troops transport. The Fusion Engine is exchanged for an XL model, which opens more room in the vehicle. A 10 ton Infantry Bay is installed in the vehicle's hull. All of the Ku's original weaponry is removed in favor of a pair of turret mounted ER Medium Lasers. For anti-infantry defense, a pair of AP Gauss Rifles are mounted on the vehicle. One is placed in the turret and the other is mounted in the front of the vehicle.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       225     25\n<b>Left</b>         170     25\n<b>Right</b>       170     25\n<b>Rear</b>        125     25\n<b>Turret</b>      135     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      825    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 2 Battle Armor Squads. Has firing ports.</color>",
    "Icon": "Ku"
  },
